by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-14T03:52:04Z","updated_at":"2026-04-14T08:57:38Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118558","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118558","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118558.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118558.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Follow up to #118483\r\n\r\nUses a dedicated pipe to signal the main process that `execvp` has failed.\r\n\r\n- `notify_pipe` is created with `O_CLOEXEC` flag which auto-closes on `exec*`. \r\n- If `execvp` returns, we write a single byte to the pipe. \r\n- In the parent / main process:\r\n  - Block reading the pipe\r\n  - if `EOF` treat is as success\r\n  - otherwise print.\r\n\r\nDidn't opt to creating dedicated loggers for the child process, this way we also get actual useful stacktrace from the scripting engines like:\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: Could not create child process: not-a-command\r\n   at: create_process (drivers/unix/os_unix.cpp:1034)\r\n   GDScript backtrace (most recent call first):\r\n       [0] run (res://test.gd:7)\r\n```\r\n\r\nMight be a small overhead increase from the block reading but the pipe either closes immediately on `exec` or writes really quickly after it fails.\r\n\r\n## Breaking changes\r\n\r\nNow, `create_process` will return `-1` if the command doesn't exists. Before it will simply return the `fork()` pid even if `execvp` fails, this behavior actually now matches the windows implementation. It is still a behavioral change whether this is a change or a bugfix.\r\n\r\n## Future works\r\n\r\n`OS_LinuxBSD::move_to_trash` and `OS_LinuxBSD::shell_open` still print errors if either `gio` or `xdg-open` isn't available. It makes the editor feel flakier than it actually is. Should've have a way to silence the log unless catastrophic.\r\n\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118558/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118558/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}